{"status":"REVIEW","clause_id":"PAY-af24a02bc335e0b8228f","clause_number":"10.8.1.1","title":"10.8.1.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin注射劑：(88/3/1、110/7/1)","source":{"key":"pay","label":"給付規定","status":"REVIEW","error":null,"indexed_nodes":6807,"tables":155,"source_name":"最新版藥品給付規定內容(整份帶走)-115.10.22更新","version":"2026-10-22","announcement_date":null,"page_updated_date":"2026-10-27","effective_date":null,"date_status":"待人工核實，未確認現行有效","verification_status":"REVIEW","pdf_url":"/documents/pay.pdf","pdf_sha256":"5bdd0292a73271c98f7f39afca6971b2bd8fbd4c78a697cd37f43ab78cd1414b"},"pdf_page_start":249,"pdf_page_end":249,"scope":"原始節點及既有子項；非人工驗證完整條文","verification_status":"REVIEW","human_verified":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007520","raw_text":"10.8.1.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin注射劑：(88/3/1、110/7/1)","display_text":"10.8.1.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin注射劑：(88/3/1、110/7/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6521]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007521","raw_text":"1.對其他抗生素有抗藥性之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","display_text":"1.對其他抗生素有抗藥性之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6522]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007522","raw_text":"2.病患對其他抗生素有嚴重過敏反應之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","display_text":"2.病患對其他抗生素有嚴重過敏反應之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6523]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007523","raw_text":"3.治療抗生素引起之腸炎(antibiotics-associated colitis)，經使用metronidazole無效者始可使用口服vancomycin。","display_text":"3.治療抗生素引起之腸炎(antibiotics-associated colitis)，經使用metronidazole無效者始可使用口服vancomycin。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6524]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007524","raw_text":"4.vancomycin 10 gm(溶液用粉劑)限骨髓移植病例使用。","display_text":"4.vancomycin 10 gm(溶液用粉劑)限骨髓移植病例使用。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6525]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007525","raw_text":"5.其他經感染症專科醫師認定需使用者。","display_text":"5.其他經感染症專科醫師認定需使用者。","numbering":n